+            // STRATA_PIPE_OVERLAP_KVS=1 with --kv-resident: the streamed part of the gate (overlap_kvs.hpp).  Every
+            // main session's QSA states (what the read writes: VRAM pages, page map, indexer rows, host copy) against
+            // the slot sessions' of the same stage (what the windows resolve, append and attend), and the main
+            // drafter's ring against the slot drafters'.  Called only with the switch on (without it the gate refuses
